WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.955 --> 00:00:08.853
Krypt Voice turns text into a voice in your song. Open it from Home, Audio Tools.

2
00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:12.938
Type a short ad-lib, pick a local voice, and hit Preview.

3
00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:21.565
Add to song drops it on a new track at the playhead.

4
00:00:24.751 --> 00:00:28.420
To sing, open a melody in the Piano Roll and click Sing my notes.

5
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.484
Type the lyrics. Each syllable lands on a note, and you see it on the roll.

6
00:00:34.387 --> 00:00:38.474
Add to song, and play.

7
00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:52.828
Cloud voices work with your own Fish Audio key. It sounds tuned, not like a real singer.
